DRAW
T 0 0 -100 60 0 0 0 TSOT-23_6 Normal 0 C C
S -500 200 500 -200 0 1 0 N
X GND_DEVICE 1 -700 100 200 R 50 50 1 1 I
X GND 2 -700 0 200 R 50 50 1 1 I
X NC 3 -700 -100 200 R 50 50 1 1 I
X VIN 4 700 -100 200 L 50 50 1 1 I
X NC 5 700 0 200 L 50 50 1 1 I
X VOUT 6 700 100 200 L 50 50 1 1 I
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
